.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rev-stealth-auth-show 1  "rev-stealth-auth-show " 
.SH NAME
rev\-stealth\-auth\-show \- Show a single profile\*(Aqs metadata (redacted)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrev\-stealth auth show\fR <\fB\-\-profile\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show a single profile\*(Aqs metadata. Cookie values are redacted; only domain / timestamps / source / AAD context are returned.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<PROFILE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  $ rev\-stealth auth show \-\-profile work
  $ rev\-stealth \-\-format json auth show \-\-profile work

EXIT CODES:
  0  Ok               Metadata emitted.
  1  UserError        Bad args / unknown profile.
  3  PermanentError   AuthStore unavailable.

ENV:
  REV_SCRAPING_AUTH_DIR        Override the AuthStore directory.
